<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <title>Order Confirmation</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f4f4f7; padding: 24px;">
  <div style="max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 32px;">
    <h2 style="color: #1a1a1a;">Your order is confirmed 🎉</h2>
    <p>We're just as excited as you are. Here's what you ordered:</p>
    <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 16px 0;">
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #666;">Order ID</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px 0; text-align: right;"><%= order._id %></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #666;">Course</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px 0; text-align: right;"><%= order.name %></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #666;">Price</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px 0; text-align: right;">$<%= order.price %></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #666;">Date</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px 0; text-align: right;"><%= order.date %></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
    <p>Thank you for your purchase!</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
